en:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Content","Community","Discovery","Shopping"]},{"type":"p","text":"will continue to become less distinct."},{"type":"h","text":"5. AI Growth Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Future growth professionals may use AI agents to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Generate experiments"},{"text":"Analyse funnels"},{"text":"Detect anomalies"},{"text":"Segment customers"},{"text":"Recommend campaigns"},{"text":"Predict churn"},{"text":"Estimate campaign ROI"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The human professional will increasingly focus on strategy, experimentation, governance and business judgment."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"flow","items":["Management","Marketing","Consumer Behaviour","Strategy"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"flow","items":["E-Commerce","Digital Marketing","Social Commerce","CRM"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Excel","SQL","Power BI","Statistics","Python"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Growth"},{"type":"flow","items":["CAC","LTV","Conversion","Retention","CRO","A/B Testing"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"flow","items":["CMS","E-Commerce Platforms","APIs","CRM","Automation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"flow","items":["Generative AI","Recommendation Systems","Forecasting","Personalisation","AI Agents"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"flow","items":["Communication","Problem Solving","Data Storytelling","Project Management","Stakeholder Management"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Progression"},{"type":"table","header":["Period","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Business + marketing + digital fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"E-commerce + SEO + social + CRM"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Analytics + growth + CRO + SQL + Power BI"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Digital strategy + automation + AI + internship"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Digital Business / E-Commerce Executive"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Digital Business / Growth / E-Commerce Analyst"}],[{"text":"4–7 years"},{"text":"Digital Business / Growth / E-Commerce Manager"}],[{"text":"7–12 years"},{"text":"Head of Digital / E-Commerce / Growth"}],[{"text":"12+ years"},{"text":"Digital Business Director / CDO / Entrepreneur"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best overall strategy"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Digital Business","Business & Marketing Foundations","E-Commerce","Digital Marketing","Analytics","SQL + Power BI","Growth & CRO","CRM & Automation","AI","Internship","Digital Business Executive","Analytics/Growth/E-Commerce Specialisation"]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest candidate should not position themselves as only a social-media or digital-marketing professional. The better long-term positioning is:"},{"type":"p","text":"“A digital business professional who understands e-commerce, customer acquisition, analytics, technology and AI, and can connect digital activity directly to customers, conversions and revenue.”"}]}]}